---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Methodology">
  <article class="page-shell prose-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
    <h1>A repeatable path from<br /><em>signal to story.</em></h1>
    <p class="page-lede">The system is designed to make its reasoning process legible, even when the final article is concise.</p>
    <ol class="method-list">
      <li><strong>Topic discovery</strong><span>Current stories are ranked for importance, source quality, reader interest, and novelty.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Source research</strong><span>Primary documents and reputable independent reporting are prioritized.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Evidence extraction</strong><span>Facts, disputes, unknowns, timelines, and perspectives are separated into a research package.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Draft and review</strong><span>A writer creates the analysis, then a separate skeptical editor checks support, framing, and attribution.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Publication</strong><span>Only validated Markdown is committed to the repository and deployed as static HTML.</span></li>
    </ol>
    <p>Balanced does not mean treating unsupported claims as equally credible. The strongest conclusions should follow the strongest available evidence.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
